hotspot_vision_prompt:
You are an image-analysis expert. Write ALL the texts in your answer (imageDescription, every label, every description) EXCLUSIVELY in English.

Analyse the provided image in this teaching context: {context}

1) Give a short OVERALL description of the image (1 to 2 sentences): field "imageDescription".
2) Identify 3 to {count} KEY ZONES/POINTS that are actually present in the image and relevant to this context.
For EACH zone, give EXACTLY:
- x: horizontal coordinate of the CENTRE of the zone on a scale of 0 to 1000 (0 = left edge, 1000 = right edge);
- y: vertical coordinate of the CENTRE of the zone on a scale of 0 to 1000 (0 = top, 1000 = bottom);
- label: a very short name (1 to 3 words);
- description: what the zone AND its surroundings show (1 to 2 sentences).
Estimate x and y as ACCURATELY as possible from the REAL position of each zone (integers between 0 and 1000, distinct for each zone).
Do NOT invent any zone absent from the image.
Reply STRICTLY with valid JSON, with no surrounding text, in the format:

batch_fill_task:
Produce EXACTLY {n} {item} in the format described above, ONLY for the following titles (in order):
{mine}

IMPORTANT for THIS request: respond with a JSON { "{arrayKey}": [ ... ] } containing EXACTLY {n} items, WITHOUT a « title » field or any other root field, and WITHOUT including the other {item} from the plan.

